  "notable_quotes": [
    "CALF-20 adsorbs CO2 by physisorption with a modest heat of adsorption: zero-loading Qst is −39 kJ mol−1 and computed binding is about −34.5 to −36.5 kJ mol−1.",
    "CALF-20 shows unusually low water uptake at low partial pressures despite good physisorptive CO2 capacity, enabling selectivity over water in wet gas capture.",
    "In humid streams, CALF-20 still preferentially captures CO2 below 40% RH, and CO2 suppresses water sorption, as also supported by computation."
  ],
